    "Id": "mechdef_gallant_GLT-7-0",
    "Name": "Gallant GLT-7-0",
    "Details": "Originally conceived with a different weapons array, the prototype Gallant's weapon package was reworked at the eleventh hour to enhance its effectiveness against combined-arms formations and was retained when it entered full production. Principally armed with two Large Pulse Lasers mounted in place of its right arm actuator, the Gallant also carried a large MRM-20 launcher in its left torso supported by an ammo efficient Streak SRM-2 rack in its right, each launcher allotted a single ton of ammunition placed in their respective side torso location. A head-mounted Flamer rounded out its weaponry.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_gallant_mech"
  },
